This project incorporates code from the following third-party project:

compose-coverflow
  Source: https://github.com/pakohan/compose-coverflow
  License: MIT
  Author: Patrick Kohan (pakohan)
  Files adapted into com/example/wearmusic/coverflow/:
    CoverFlow.kt, CoverFlowParams.kt (merged from Geometry.kt + DistanceFactor.kt),
    CoverFlowState.kt, CoverFlowScope.kt, Cover.kt, Mirror.kt

The Cover Flow geometry / reflection algorithm is derived from that project and
used under the terms of its MIT license, above. Local modifications: package
rename, removal of @Parcelize, and adaptation to Jetpack Compose 1.6.7 APIs
(Dp conversion, custom bouncy fling behavior).